    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9847" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιγρᾰφ-εύς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έως</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>checking-</i> or <i>copying-clerk,</i> a public
			officer, <i><span class="en">
